WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.633
Equal groups

2
00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:10.400
Three trays are ready for the coffee ceremony. Each tray has four cups.

3
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.400
Four, eight, twelve.

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.467
Three groups of four make twelve.

5
00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:21.067
Three times four equals twelve.
